OL,6,CG2001FThe 3,500th edition of Blue
OL,7,FPeter airs on BBC One. Former
OL,8,Fpresenters Val Singleton (1960s/1970s),
OL,9,FPeter Duncan (1980s) and John Leslie
OL,10,F(1990s) took part in the Brain of Blue
OL,11,FPeter quiz along with the four current
OL,12,Fpresenters.
