OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG2003FOn the programme's 45th
OL,7,Fanniversary, 11-year-old competition
OL,8,Fwinner Ryan Gilpin became the first
OL,9,Fviewer to co-present Blue Peter. Also,
OL,10,Fas part of the birthday celebrations,
OL,11,Fthe white Blue Peter badge was
OL,12,Frevamped, for the first time in 15
OL,13,Fyears. It could only be won during the
OL,14,Fanniversary year.
